The vertex shader of dEQP-GLES2.functional.uniform_api.value.initial.render.array_in_struct.mat4_mat2_vertex (and of its _both and value.initial.get_uniform siblings, which dEQP writes with the same vertex shader) as dEQP-GLES2 (VK-GL-CTS 93bca01) writes it: the verbatim .qpa source of tools/mali/testdata/deqp_vsuniarr_struct_mat.vert with each comparison constant replaced by the zero value of the initial cases (es2fUniformApiTests.cpp generateZeroVarValue and shaderVarValueStr: a float 0.00, an int 0, a bool false). Plan #387 item vsunifarr-design, docs/notes/mali-vsuarr-lowering.md.
